              "value": "Undead Mastery"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, divine, necromancy)\n\n100 feet. Commanded or allied undead in the aura that have a lower level than the mummy pharaoh gain a +1 circumstance bonus to attack rolls, damage rolls, AC, saves, and skill checks."
